  "details": "I think it would be interesting to make the TOS easily accessible through the menu or in world so that people don't get confused on what the TOS is. It could also be pulled up like the marketplace items are through a worldobject that you select.\n\nMake it big and readable too! So people with eye strain such as myself can easily see it.\n\nMany visitors don't even know the TOS. It would be interesting also to put a blurb about the TOS at spawn in the VRChat default homeworld.",
